# Maestro

- Policy SoT: `decide()` in `policy.ts`. Deny is final (no confirm).
- Page scope via `session`: `patch` on Patch page, `system` on Global page.
- `changePlan` → working-copy fields only (Patch page).
- `writeSystem` / `stageSystemPlan` → Global page only; system host writes DT1 immediately + snapshot.
- Never `writeSlot` / factory reset.
- Model never sees SysEx addresses; registry keys / human labels only (`fieldRegistry.ts`).
- Macros: `macros/registry.ts` — set `implemented: true` only when writes are real.
- Keys: sessionStorage by default; optional localStorage; `npm run check:secrets`.
- Architecture notes: `docs/current/maestro-architecture.md`.
